      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Just so it isn't overlooked when it eventually gets fixed, I'd like to point out this issue is also present with OwnerBufferOne.\n\nI ran into the same exact issue with a world I was recently working on and couldn't figure out what was going on until I stumbled across this bug report.",
